    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I notice there are several important questions here about improving our collaboration and transparency. Let me address each point:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Consistent .cursorrules Updates**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Currently, I should be updating the `.cursorrules` file after each significant interaction, but I haven't been as consistent as I should be. To improve this, we could add an explicit rule in my instructions that requires me to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Update the Multi-Agent Scratchpad after each significant user interaction"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Verbally announce when I'm making these updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-82",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Summarize what was updated"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Process Transparency**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You're right that I could be more verbose about my tool usage. I propose we add a rule that requires me to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Explain my thought process before using each tool"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Describe what I expect to find/achieve"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Summarize what I learned after using the tool"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Explicitly state when I'm switching between Planner and Executor roles"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Scratchpad Usage**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I see there's some ambiguity about `scratchpad.md` vs `.cursorrules`. Let me clarify the current setup:"
